{"updated":"2026-09-30T14:23:27.325Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: What if art could help you live longer?. Elsewhere, palestinian archaeologists race against time to save Gaza’s heritage. And MI5 China alert will send chill through UK’s cash-strapped universities. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.1 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.9 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 2.5 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 35 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.6 near 74 km S of Yonakuni, Japan. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.31,0.36,0.41,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.09,1.37,1.49,1.53,1.57,1.59,1.64,1.66,1.68,1.71,1.75,1.8,1.88,1.94,1.99,2.02,2.06,2.1,2.14,2.17,2.23,2.28,2.31,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.47,2.52,2.57,2.62,2.68,2.74,2.86,2.97,3.12,3.16,3.19,3.23,3.29,3.33,3.39,3.48,3.56,3.62,3.69,3.73,3.79,3.82,3.87,3.91,3.94,3.96,4,4.03,4.05,4.08,4.12,4.17,4.25,4.31,4.37,4.41,4.47,4.53,4.56,4.62,4.64,4.7,4.82,4.97,5.14,5.65,5.71,5.77,5.82,5.86,5.91,5.96,5.99,6.08,6.26,6.33,6.4,6.44,6.47,6.5,6.54,6.56,6.59,6.64,6.66,6.7,6.76,6.8,6.86,6.88,6.92,6.94,7.01,7.06,7.12,7.16,7.2,7.25,7.29,7.35,7.41,7.48,7.55,7.62,7.73,7.86,8.37,8.49,8.54,8.6,8.65,8.7,8.74,8.78,8.84,8.96,9,9.15,9.22,9.3,9.36,9.43,9.46,9.53,9.6,9.66,9.73,9.78,9.81,9.88,9.94,10,10.05,10.09,10.11,10.16,10.23,10.29,10.35,10.41,10.51,10.55,10.62,10.69,10.81,10.89,10.96,11.03,11.08,11.11,11.16,11.2,11.24,11.27,11.32,11.37,11.41,11.45,11.52,11.63,11.7,11.74,11.77,11.81,11.84,11.91,11.96,12.11,12.18,12.22,12.26,12.32,12.47,12.55,12.62,12.65,12.68,12.72,12.76,12.82,12.89,12.96,13.02,13.13,13.18,13.35,13.47,13.98,14.05,14.11,